<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Module 10 Worksheet</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #1e293b;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 40px auto;
    max-width: 800px;
    padding: 0 20px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 26px;
    color: #0f172a;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #7b4fce;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  h2, h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #7b4fce;
    margin-top: 35px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border-left: 4px solid #00c8ff;
    padding-left: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #334155;
  }
  ul {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding-left: 5px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  li {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .checkbox {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-family: monospace;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-right: 10px;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .instructions {
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    border-left: 4px solid #7b4fce;
    padding: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #475569;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .question {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-top: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .response-box {
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px dashed #7b4fce;
    border-left: 4px solid #7b4fce;
    padding: 15px 20px;
    margin: 10px 0 25px 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #475569;
  }
  .response-label {
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #7b4fce;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-family: monospace;
  }
  .response-placeholder {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  hr {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    margin: 40px 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>PlayIQ Module 10 Worksheet: Assistants, Empathy, and Ethics</h1>
<div class="instructions"><strong>Instructions:</strong> Complete this worksheet thoughtfully. Remember, PlayIQ is about using AI as a coach, not a crutch. Your goal is to become an independent learner!</div>
<hr>
<h3>Part 1: Assistant Purpose and Boundaries</h3>
<div class="question">1. (Short Response) Why is an AI assistant that "helps with everything" actually less useful than an assistant that has one specific, clear job?</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="question">2. (Multiple Choice) Which of the following is an example of a clear Assistant Purpose?</div>
<ul>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "This assistant does homework."</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "This assistant helps me plan weekly meals by organizing preferences, while avoiding diet advice."</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "This assistant makes me smarter."</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "This assistant is funny."</li>
</ul>
<div class="question">3. (Classification) You create an assistant to help you study history. You tell it: "Do not give me answers; only give me hints, and never write my essays." What kind of boundary is this? (Privacy, Permission, Decision, Safety, or Accuracy)</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="question">4. (Teach-Back) Explain the difference between a Privacy Boundary (what info it shouldn't know) and a Decision Boundary (what choices it shouldn't make for you).</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<hr>
<h3>Part 2: Custom Instructions for Real Tasks</h3>
<div class="question">5. (Short Response) Why should custom instructions include what the assistant should NOT do?</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="question">6. (Multiple Choice) Which of the following is the best "Output Format" instruction for an AI assistant helping you organize your chores?</div>
<ul>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "Write a 5-page essay about chores."</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "Just tell me what to do."</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "Provide a simple checklist with checkboxes."</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "Output in a confusing format."</li>
</ul>
<div class="question">7. (Prompt Improvement) Upgrade this weak assistant instruction: "Help me practice Spanish." Make it more specific by defining a role, goal, user context, and what NOT to do.</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="question">8. (Teach-Back) Explain how writing custom instructions for a task makes an AI much better than just using generic ChatGPT.</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
