<h3>Part 4: Building for Someone Else</h3>
<div class="question">13. (Short Response) When building an assistant for someone else, why is it important to interview them instead of just guessing what they want?</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
