<div class="question">15. (Multiple Choice) Which of the following is a good question to ask during a User Interview?</div>
<ul>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "What task would you like help with?"</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "What makes that task annoying?"</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> "What information are you comfortable sharing?"</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> All of the above.</li>
</ul>
<div class="question">16. (Teach-Back) Explain why empathy (understanding someone else's feelings and needs) is the most important skill when building tools for other people.</div>
