<h3>Part 5: Ethics, Privacy, and Boundaries</h3>
<div class="question">17. (Short Response) "Building assistants gives you power. Power requires responsibility." What does it mean to be a "responsible" AI Builder?</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
