</div>
<div class="question">18. (Multiple Choice) The "Assistant Builder Responsibility Check" includes which of the following questions?</div>
<ul>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Did the user agree to the purpose?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Are private details protected?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Are boundaries clear?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> All of the above.</li>
</ul>
<div class="question">19. (Scenario) You build an assistant for a friend that automatically emails their teachers. However, you didn't include a rule that says "ask the human to verify the email before sending." Why is this a dangerous missing boundary?</div>
